SCOPE: this MIT licence covers the code written for this plugin (Host plugin,
client UI, renderers, build and test tooling). Since 0.9.0 the npm package
contains only MIT-licensed code: the dsh-pv renderer in .dsh-plugin/client/mv/dshpv/
is ported from MisakaZentai/world-execute-me-dsh-pv under the MIT licence,
Copyright (c) 2026 MisakaZentai (see NOTICE.md).

NOT covered by this licence (repository only, not in the npm package):
- presets/world-execute-me/src/ (scenes.gen.mjs, film.mjs, canvas.mjs, pyrt.mjs):
  a port of world.execute-me-ascii by yym8224961, used and redistributed with
  that author's permission, which is NOT an open-source licence. It is published
  as the "world-execute-me" workshop pack. See NOTICE.md before reusing it.
- presets/dsh-pv/art/: whale-girl images licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (licence text
  and attribution chain in that folder). presets/dsh-pv/data/ is MIT
  (MisakaZentai). Both are published as the "world-execute-me-dsh-pv" workshop pack.
